{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_001har_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_001har_001_1000_p", "source_sha256": "8e57797eaaa9775c531ddb8e575a0c565a06e14fbac9976e4e973508f42d21cd", "ja": "（39プロジェクトの準備もだいたい整った。\n新劇場も完成……。ここからが本番だな！）", "zh": "（39PROJECT准备得差不多了。\n新的剧场也已经完工……接着就是该让好戏上场了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_001har_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_001har_001_1001_001har", "source_sha256": "fbdf35f432b3fe72d82fa117162daf26b25398a5a8c161191687898b694fd561", "ja": "あ、{$P$}さーん！", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_001har_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_001har_001_1002_p", "source_sha256": "952114cd7822f91870a56f1b58499cdff28d9ccc00c2f70c378f02c40914ef5d", "ja": "ん？　この声は……春香？", "zh": "嗯？这个声音是……春香？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_001har_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_001har_001_1003_001har", "source_sha256": "3f886463a722a704edccabacbe4656054e3cc83f3eacdbe22c0e8ca40ede1e8a", "ja": "{$P$}さんも、今帰るところなん……\nでっ、きゃあああっ！", "zh": "{$P$}先生也正要回……\n咦？呀啊～～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_001har_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_001har_001_1004_se", "source_sha256": "207c7e01228933441336cae15deeccf2fd1228fd6870491532d33366da906cca", "ja": "すってーん！", "zh": "（跌倒）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_001har_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_001har_001_1005_p", "source_sha256": "2879844eca1faac52f8fad42397ecbdc8d49c921af277bf6442e72f0db9aa25d", "ja": "春香！？　そんな何もない所で……大丈夫か？", "zh": "春香！？居然在什么都没有的地方摔跤……你还好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_001har_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_001har_001_1006_001har", "source_sha256": "e68692e313a3341d786dbfae9522330afaa1c3dc852526252fbdd288c236f4be", "ja": "す、すいません、ちょっと小石に\nつまづいちゃって……。失敗失敗♪", "zh": "对、对不起，被小石子绊倒了……\n我真是不小心♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_001har_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_001har_001_1007_p", "source_sha256": "62823b8f3680ecc14c20248bb63a9ffdc4e2e1f3cacb609fabd9860a4c300a96", "ja": "そうか。小石にか……。", "zh": "这样啊，因为小石子啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_001har_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_001har_001_1008_001har", "source_sha256": "9fab14fb2a3a933126a0f72897ad4b80dd6a25c3df333b2257312afa9baeaf7b", "ja": "それより{$P$}さん！\nついに始まりましたね、39プロジェクト！", "zh": "是说{$P$}先生！\n39PROJECT终于启动了呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_001har_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_001har_001_1009_001har", "source_sha256": "f7889a9dc67e980c14fbd4bdf1f6902aa4da5a77e513e6ef8f2619501a4531bf", "ja": "新しいアイドルの子達が、い～っぱい来るんですよね？\nどんな子が来るのかなぁ……。今から楽しみです♪", "zh": "接下来会有很多新偶像加入对吧？\n会是些怎样的人呢……我已经在期待了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_001har_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_001har_001_1010_p", "source_sha256": "a5e632cea0569b35712c60cf5d3866c99f6ace8018c8a457c811b7c388e68760", "ja": "そうだな。このプロジェクトで、春香もついに先輩に\nなるわけだ。……後輩達のこと、よろしく頼むぞ。", "zh": "对啊，开始这个PROJECT之后，春香也要当前辈了。\n……新人们就麻烦你多多关照啰。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_001har_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_001har_001_1011_001har", "source_sha256": "2383b7a56e2f5bb41e0ddfbfb73d491ea7dd611d6f8bcca253530ee603121df0", "ja": "ええっ！？　そんな、私が先輩だなんて！\nまだダンスはとちるし、歌詞だって忘れるし……。", "zh": "咦咦！？我居然成了前辈！\n人家到现在舞都还会跳错，唱歌也会忘词……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_001har_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_001har_001_1012_001har", "source_sha256": "733148401c2241a5e9758a1b95d7dea8dd399fcd67d692a7178ef1b6fd0ca9c6", "ja": "あの、ぜんぜん早いって思います！", "zh": "那个，我觉得当前辈对我而言还太早了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_001har_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_001har_001_1013_p", "source_sha256": "651179760b1ef2a046f8d0da76880b90957f58471619af92e493927d0ef09dc4", "ja": "でも先輩は先輩だからな……。\nそれに、少しも早くないと思うよ。", "zh": "但这也改不了你是前辈的事实……\n而且我觉得其实一点也不早喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_001har_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_001har_001_1014_p", "source_sha256": "afadb7c63d49cb2e860297dafd4ea62d3ddbbcb5114bc8497bbc9d1a1f4fdbd0", "ja": "春香はアイドルとして、立派に活動できてるんだ。\n胸を張って、後輩達を迎えてやって欲しいな。", "zh": "春香作为偶像，表现得一直都很出色。\n我希望你可以拿出自信，好好迎接新人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_001har_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_001har_001_1015_001har", "source_sha256": "a443728a8175b991932eba7c1377a7feb90b5c05a89ee687339a5281a0ed75e9", "ja": "{$P$}さん……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_001har_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_001har_001_1016_001har", "source_sha256": "f290022fe77b743b7fff9df992dc3635f776096443e6b1ff240d95ae33b8a551", "ja": "そ、そうですよねっ。お仕事とか、少しは経験\nしてるんだし。しっかりしなくちゃ、ですよね！", "zh": "说、说得也是呢！我也算有一些工作的经验，\n得努力当个好榜样才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_001har_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_001har_001_1017_p", "source_sha256": "2507dac5b3e6baa3928f3d2173cf690e71f8d8a55c6c1e3498d091a3dea5dd1f", "ja": "ああ、頼りにしてるから。\n新しい仲間達と一緒に、劇場を盛り上げていこうな！", "zh": "嗯，就交给你了。\n跟新伙伴们一起带动剧场的气氛吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_001har_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_001har_001_1018_001har", "source_sha256": "cae88673ab6d86d5713a90b4684776127554c76c7e164ce9639d3a9ad9e5507a", "ja": "はいっ♪　それにしても……新しい仲間かぁ～。\nみんなで楽しく活動できるといいなぁ……。", "zh": "好的♪话说回来……新伙伴呀～\n希望大家能一起快快乐乐地当偶像……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_001har_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_001har_001_1019_001har", "source_sha256": "3c48d989ba984d61378f217730aa9424aaee6e903e447139f624123b45af37b8", "ja": "みんなお揃いの衣装で真新しいステージの上に並んで。\n一斉にライトを浴びて……。", "zh": "和大家穿着同款的表演服装站上舞台，\n一起沐浴在聚光灯之下……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_001har_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_001har_001_1020_001har", "source_sha256": "578b5b46186eb78f6770120690182e7b6989b416eb7a9bbac1910fd227e406b9", "ja": "うん、頑張らなくちゃ！　改めて、よろしく\nお願いしますね、{$P$}さん♪", "zh": "嗯，我得加油才行！要再次请你多多指教了，\n{$P$}先生♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_001har_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_001har_001_1021_p", "source_sha256": "2a54cde51c75d163c20c7b60264943ee342cbcd48daa978a7c3ebc2d33c63889", "ja": "こちらこそ。\nよろしく、春香！", "zh": "嗯，我也要请你多多指教，\n春香！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_001har_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_001har_001_1022_001har", "source_sha256": "4a4d0e960edac36edeab116837e05033c19398860cce32d5e6f190e83ca84566", "ja": "あ、駅が見えてきました。それじゃ、私はここで。\n失礼しま～……と、と、きゃあああ！", "zh": "啊，车站就在前面了。那我先回……\n啊、啊、呀啊～～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_001har_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_001har_001_1023_p", "source_sha256": "3c38f399b1f821f4d9f06276c19a5b033e0cb8cb4ba93fbb8e72edfc6cc234c4", "ja": "あっ、春香！", "zh": "啊，春香！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_001har_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_001har_001_1024", "source_sha256": "97ea80d18189fee11687166bbec9d0917bf0657e6f06ae7f1d0abf681b93a085", "ja": "危ない！", "zh": "小心！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_001har_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_001har_001_2000_p", "source_sha256": "b9cececfbc8cb46e41feebd61706cd4b55a0d6881e94838f0db87f9fc4f5b5b5", "ja": "危な……、ん？", "zh": "小心……嗯？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_001har_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_001har_001_2001_001har", "source_sha256": "096a6aaae60ad47af6e10f6ad5a96936a128b54c68191b635a2e7d3beaf9214d", "ja": "っとと、危なかったぁ……。あ、大丈夫です♪\nありがとうございます、{$P$}さん。", "zh": "呼呼，真是好险……啊，我没事唷♪\n谢谢你，{$P$}先生。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_001har_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_001har_001_2002_001har", "source_sha256": "42e3a81b81bb32500f799626dd21f8fc76ba14a2ee39a5335a5ee491a4e3e9f3", "ja": "私も、もう簡単に転ぶわけにはいきません！\n先輩として、しっかりしなくちゃいけませんから♪", "zh": "我已经、已经不会再轻易跌倒了！\n毕竟身为前辈，我得让自己可靠一点才行♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_001har_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_001har_001_2003_001har", "source_sha256": "9fed01407b90f96af06794606eaf65604036dd0331ecae9ca404c3c5f9858db5", "ja": "それじゃ、改めて。お疲れさまでした～！", "zh": "那么，重来一次，辛苦了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_001har_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_001har_001_2004_p", "source_sha256": "18bf407440a92cf611e66d3aff1da708bb40078b0e511c1ae9b8e33febeab838", "ja": "（……希望にあふれた笑顔を浮かべて、\n春香は駆け出していく）", "zh": "（……春香带着充满希望的笑脸，\n向前方奔去。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_001har_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_001har_001_2005_p", "source_sha256": "c228a96049fa57af8227e09d10dc49bf0b1024b1e13f3d305e320a48ce853ff1", "ja": "（その背中は、後輩たちを\nしっかりと引っ張ってくれるだろう）", "zh": "（相信她的背影会确实地\n带领新人们朝目标前进吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_001har_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_001har_001_2006_001har", "source_sha256": "598496a82cf3046d78a3d1bd98f6c60b37b24670cd52cc2a41c9321a50bd9673", "ja": "きゃああああ～～～！！", "zh": "呀啊～～～～！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_001har_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_001har_001_2007_se", "source_sha256": "e42a2bea12c3b3ac0b85f9dae24c108871ec19aa65c31a8d4168a161aa5ef3ce", "ja": "どんがらがっしゃーん！！", "zh": "（摔了一跤）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_001har_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_001har_001_2008_p", "source_sha256": "7e0e460aa55e9855d7b6a4e85a0fb0e7014ca557af3b72ef26b996fec9b7245a", "ja": "（きっと引っ張ってくれる……はずだ。\nとりあえず、急いで様子を見に行こう！）", "zh": "（她一定会带领大家……大概吧。\n先别说这些了，赶紧去看看她的状况吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
